# One Agent Runtime (locked)

**Canonical:** `docs/adr/045-one-agent-runtime.md` · `lib/workstream/rimvio-agent-runtime.ts`

> **새 Runtime 만들지 말 것.** Capability Registry 또는 Runtime stage에만 추가.

```
User → enterRimvioAgentRuntime() → Observe→Judge→Plan→Execute→Verify→Repair→Commit
```

| Add feature as… | Not as… |
|-----------------|---------|
| Judge / Planner / Executor / Verifier stage | `lib/new-agent-runtime` |
| Capability (`booking`, `search`, `vision`…) | Peer “Booking Runtime OS” |
| Agent Memory facet | Parallel memory store |

Strategies: Quick · Lookup · Planning · Simulation · Execution · Recovery · Observation.

Roles: Observer · **Supervisor** · Judge · Planner · **Coordinator** · Executor · Verifier · Repairer · Committer · Historian.

Behavior quality (ADR-046): Goal Supervisor · World State · Opportunities · Reflection — still one Runtime.

Confidence low → Lookup first. Verification is default loop, not optional.

## PR reject

New Runtime package · Ingress bypass · Capability reinvented as second Spine · Skip Supervisor on hard Goals
